#!/usr/bin/env ruby
# The P0 demo (spec 08; --example watchers for examples/watchers). Seeds the
# demo through the real write path with the fixture-driven example agent, then
# prints every golden value with PASS/FAIL and the replay check. Exits non-zero
# on any FAIL. Use --reset to truncate a development database first.
